#. Tag: title
#: wizard.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kppp; wizard"
msgstr "&kppp; asistent"

#. Tag: title
#: wizard.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting the Wizard."
msgstr "Pokretanje Asistenta."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can start the wizard from &kppp;'s initial screen. Start &kppp; from "
"your <guimenu>K</guimenu> menu, where you will find its entry in the "
"<guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu> as <guimenuitem>Internet Dial-Up Tool</"
"guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Asistenta možete pokrenuti sa &kppp;'s inicijalnog zaslona. Pokrenite &kppp; "
"iz Vašeg <guimenu>K</guimenu> menija, gdje možete naći njegov ulaz na "
"<guisubmenu>Internet</guisubmenu> kao <guimenuitem>Alat za pozivanje "
"interneta</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following dialog will appear:"
msgstr "Sljedeći dijalog će se pojaviti:"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: wizard.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The &kppp; dialer startup screen</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kppp; Početni zaslon pozivanja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: wizard.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The &kppp; dialer startup screen</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> &kppp; Početni zaslon pozivanja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The &kppp; dialer startup screen</para>"
msgstr "<para>&kppp; Početni zaslon pozivanja</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It will probably not have any entries to begin with, and that's what we're "
"about to do now."
msgstr ""
"Vjerovatno neće imati nikakav unos sa kojim će početi, i to je nešto o čemu "
"ćemo sada saznati."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>Configure</guibutton> button to open the "
"<guilabel>&kppp; Configuration</guilabel> dialog. On the <guilabel>Accounts</"
"guilabel> tab select <guilabel>New...</guilabel> to begin setting up a new "
"Internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite dugme <guibutton>Konfiguracije</guibutton> da otvorite "
"<guilabel>&kppp; Konfiguracijski</guilabel> dijalog. Na kartici "
"<guilabel>Računi</guilabel> odaberite <guilabel>Novo...</guilabel> da "
"započnete postavljanje nove Internet konekcije."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The dialog will offer you three choices, <guibutton>Wizard</guibutton>, "
"<guibutton>Manual Setup</guibutton> and <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"Dijalog će Vam ponuditi tri izbora, <guibutton>Asistent</guibutton>, "
"<guibutton>Ručne postavke</guibutton> i <guibutton>Prekini</guibutton>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: wizard.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The dialog asks you what you want to do...</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Dijalog Vas pita šta želite učiniti...</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: wizard.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The dialog asks you what you want to do...</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Dijalog Vas pita šta želite učiniti...</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "The dialog asks you what you want to do"
msgstr "Dijalog Vas pita šta želite učiniti"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: wizard.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wizard"
msgstr "Asistent"

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have a fairly standard modem, and use one of the larger ISP's for "
"your country, the wizard will probably be able to set you up immediately "
"with a working Internet Connection. Try this first, before you try to set up "
"the connection manually."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate sasvim standardan modem, i koristite jednu od većih ISP za Vašu "
"zemlju, asistent će vjerovatno biti u mogućnosti da Vam ormah postavi "
"ispravnu Internet konekciju. Pokušajte najprije ovo, prije nego pokušate "
"ručno postaviti konekciju."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: wizard.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manual Setup"
msgstr "Ručne postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you don't succeed with the Wizard, or you just want to do things "
"yourself, choose this. The wizard currently is only useful for a small "
"subset of countries and Internet Providers."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ne uspijete sa Asistentom, ili jednostavno želite da sami to "
"uradite, izaberite ovo. Asistent je trenutno koristan samo za mali podset "
"zemalja i Internet provajdera."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: wizard.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Poništi"

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose this if you really don't want to be setting up a new account right "
"now. The message box will go away, and you will be left with the dialer "
"screen as before."
msgstr ""
"Ovo izaberite ukoliko zaista ne želite trenutno da postavljate novu "
"konekciju.  Okvir poruke će nestati, i nalazit ćete se na zaslonu pozivanja "
"kao i ranije."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the purposes of this chapter, we'll assume you are choosing "
"<guibutton>Wizard</guibutton>, and the dialog based setup will be described "
"in a later chapter."
msgstr ""
"Za svrhe ovog ogranka,  pretpostavit ćemo da birate <guibutton>Asistent</"
"guibutton>, a dijaloški bazirane postavke će biti  opisane u kasnijem "
"ogranku."

#. Tag: title
#: wizard.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Rest of the Wizard"
msgstr "Ostatak Asistenta"

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first screen you see contains just introductory text, explaining the "
"things you read about in the first section of this chapter. Press "
"<guibutton>Next</guibutton> to move on."
msgstr ""
"Prvi zaslon koji vidite sadrži samo uvodni tekst, te objašnjava stvari koje "
"ste pročitali u prvoj sekciji ovog ogranka. Pritisnite <guibutton>Sljedeće</"
"guibutton> da nastavite dalje."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second screen asks you to choose the country you live in. Not all "
"countries are represented here, and if the country you live in is not "
"listed, you will have to press <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>, in which case "
"the <link linkend=\"dialog-setup\">Dialog based setup</link> will start for "
"you to continue with."
msgstr ""
"Drugi zaslon od Vas traži da izaberete zemlju u kojoj živite. Nisu sve "
"države predstavljene ovdje, te ako država u kojoj živite nije na listi, "
"trebat ćete pritisnuti <guibutton>Poništi</guibutton>,  te će se u tom "
"slućaju pokrenuti <link linkend=\"dialog-setup\">Dijaloški bazirane "
"postavke</link> kako biste nastavili sa tim."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the next screen, you will be given a choice of Internet Providers that "
"&kppp; knows about, based on your choice of location in the previous screen. "
"Again, if your <acronym>ISP</acronym> is not listed here, you will have to "
"press <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> and do your setup in the <link linkend="
"\"dialog-setup\">Dialog based setup</link>"
msgstr ""
"Na sljedećem zaslonu, bit će vam dat izbor Internet provajdera za koje "
"&kppp; zna, bazirane na izboru lokacije sa prethodnog zaslona. Opet, ukoliko "
"Vaš <acronym>ISP</acronym> nije na ovoj listi, trebat ćete pritisnuti "
"<guibutton>Poništi</guibutton> i napraviti Vaše postavke u <link linkend="
"\"dialog-setup\">Dijaloški bazirane postavke</link>"

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will now be asked to enter your username and password for your internet "
"connection. Please note, that for some <acronym>ISP</acronym>s this differs "
"from your mail account user name and password, so make sure you use the "
"right one. Choose <guibutton>Next</guibutton> to continue."
msgstr ""
"Sada će Vam se tražiti da upišete korisničko ime i šifru za Vašu Internet "
"konekciju. Molimo imajte na umu da se za neke <acronym>ISP</acronym>-ove ovo "
"razlikuje od korisničkog imena i šifre Vašeg mail računa, pa budite sigurni "
"da koristite ispravne. Izaberite <guibutton>Sljedeće</guibutton> da "
"nastavite."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the next screen, you have a chance to enter any special dial prefixes you "
"might have - for example, if you must dial <quote>0</quote> for an outside "
"line, or if have a prefix you can dial to turn off call waiting. Choose "
"<guibutton>Next</guibutton> to continue."
msgstr ""
"Na sljedećem zaslonu, imat ćete mogućnost da unesete bilo kakve specijalne "
"pozivne prefikse koje možda imate - na primjer, ako morate pozivati "
"<quote>0</quote> za vanjske linije, ili ukoliko imate prefiks koji možete "
"pozvati da ukinete čekanje poziva. Izaberite <guibutton>Sljedeće</guibutton> "
"da nastavite."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"And that's all! If you want to revisit any of your choices, you can use the "
"<guibutton>Back</guibutton> and <guibutton>Next</guibutton> buttons to move "
"back and forth through the dialogs. When you're happy, press the "
"<guibutton>Finish</guibutton> button, and you're all done."
msgstr ""
"I to je sve! Ako želite da ponovo posjetite neki Vaš izbor, možete koristiti "
"dugme <guibutton>Nazad</guibutton> i <guibutton>Sljedeće</guibutton> da se "
"krećete naprijed ili nazad kroz dijalog. Kada ste zadovoljni, pritisnite "
"dugme <guibutton>Završi</guibutton> i gotovi ste!."

#. Tag: para
#: wizard.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Of course, any of this information can be edited at a later time, from the "
"&kppp; Configuration dialog."
msgstr ""
"Naravno, bilo koja od ovih informacija može biti uređena naknadno, iz &kppp; "
"Konfiguracijskog dijaloga."
